6) API Details
------------------------------------------------------------
6.1 Candidate APIs

GET /typing/api_backend/config.php
Output:
- default_test_minutes
Behavior:
- Returns globally configured default test duration (fallback 1 minute).

POST /typing/api_backend/login.php
Input JSON:
- cnic
- rollno
- otp

Output status values:
- ok
- invalid_password
- notfound
- already_tested
- already_logged

Important behavior:
- Validates active session for current date only.
- Validates candidate center against session center.
- Sets logged_once=1 and updates last_login if column exists.
- Adds/updates live_candidates record.

GET /typing/api_backend/get_paragraph.php
Output:
- content
- title (if found)
Behavior:
- Returns random active paragraph.
- Falls back to default hardcoded text if no active paragraph found.

POST /typing/api_backend/save_result.php
Input JSON:
- result object (uid, roll_no, center_id, total_words_typed, correct_words, incorrect_words, wpm, accuracy, time)
Behavior:
- Inserts into results.
- Updates users.tested=1.
- Sets live_candidates.finished_at for active record.

